#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:1
#: b1149afd1b4f4055ae3e1df11877e52d
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "開始使用"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:3
#: 4dbbb275d8d14b3d8edf5a33008f541a
msgid "Run the backend and frontend"
msgstr "啟動後端與前端"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:5
#: 0a103324f4e247468f423a0c0fb5a48f
msgid ""
"The workbench is a browser app talking to a pricing service. Both have to"
" be running, and the service comes first."
msgstr "這套工作台是一個瀏覽器應用程式，與一個定價服務對談。兩者都要在執行中，而且服務要先啟動。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:17
#: 67cee683f384445fa6ab5b4f5d9c6a77
msgid ""
"`npm install` generates `src/gen/` from the `proto/` submodule. Those "
"bindings are deliberately not committed — one source of truth, no stale "
"copies — so a fresh clone must run it before the app will build."
msgstr ""
"`npm install` 會從 `proto/` 子模組產生 "
"`src/gen/`。這些繫結刻意不納入版本控制——只留一份真相來源，不留過期副本——因此剛複製下來的專案必須先跑過它，應用程式才能建置。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:21
#: fab48a292d5945c5b52e78b9b4d690e8
msgid ""
"`VITE_WS_URL` overrides the service address if it is not on "
"`ws://127.0.0.1:9111`; `.env.example` carries the default."
msgstr "若服務不在 `ws://127.0.0.1:9111`，以 `VITE_WS_URL` 覆寫位址；預設值放在 `.env.example`。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:24
#: 8446d9f5e33e4ceb8619d4d3f154afd8
msgid "Choosing the command line"
msgstr "挑選你的命令列"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:26
#: f559e8b8626743e899a0ffb1a76b5679
msgid ""
"The service takes its address and its secret from two flags that do "
"nothing to each other. `--host` decides who can *reach* it, `--token-"
"file` decides who may *drive* it, and the four combinations worth knowing"
" are these:"
msgstr "服務的位址與它的密鑰，來自兩個彼此不相干的旗標。`--host` 決定誰*搆得到*它，`--token-file` 決定誰可以*驅動*它，而值得知道的四種組合就是這些："

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md
#: 9b6cbad591b941cfbe4984f05a72ede0
msgid "What you run"
msgstr "你執行的指令"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md
#: f20d66f51f1449b68f834fc0b08eed5f
msgid "It listens on"
msgstr "它監聽在"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md
#: e087259e839146fdb4ace7c4ce1f0430
msgid "A client must present"
msgstr "客戶端必須出示"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md
#: 1402eeb7b46f48288bced5e2a5f73390
