msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md
#: 1d83573396604e5a8fab43ce8c8d8abd
msgid "nothing: it exits `2`"
msgstr "什麼都沒有：它以 `2` 結束"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md
#: 0990e3bcbc7840f6a2b6a91ed6566ab3
msgid "—"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:37
#: 650c5cc094954daa8d5504aed384edd6
msgid ""
"**The first row is the default**, and it is what the rest of this guide "
"assumes: one person on one machine, where the origin check is the whole "
"door."
msgstr "**第一列是預設值**，也是這份指南其餘部分所假設的情況：一個人、一台機器，而 origin 檢查就是那整道門。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:40
#: 8514204eb7104090a4d7b862f573855f
msgid ""
"**The second row is the one to reach for on a shared machine**, and it is"
" the row people expect the third one to be. `--token-file` does not put "
"the service on the network. It leaves the service exactly where it was "
"and adds a lock, and that is the combination that closes the one gap "
"loopback never did: another user's process on the same box, opening the "
"port directly. [The token, on a machine you share](#the-token-on-a"
"-machine-you-share) below is how to give it one, and what it costs you to"
" do so."
msgstr "**在共用機器上該伸手拿的是第二列**，而大家常以為第三列才是。`--token-file` 並不會把服務放到網路上。它讓服務待在原處，只是加上一把鎖，而那正是補上 loopback 從來沒補上的那個缺口的組合：同一台機器上另一個使用者的行程，直接打開這個埠。下面的[共用機器上的權杖](#the-token-on-a-machine-you-share)說明怎麼給它一把鎖，以及這麼做要付出什麼。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:48
#: 272c1ce2e1cd4ab6bd2fd69107d65e8e
msgid ""
"**The third row is allowed rather than recommended.** The guard that "
"produces the fourth row stops the accident of an unauthenticated service "
"on a routable address; it does not make the configuration a safe one. "
"There is no TLS, so the token crosses the network in the clear on every "
"handshake and anybody who can watch the traffic has it from then on. A "
"single shared secret is not an identity either: everyone who connects is "
"the same nobody, and one holder cannot be revoked without rotating the "
"file for all of them. If the service genuinely has to answer another "
"machine, leave it on loopback and put a reverse proxy in front of it that"
" terminates TLS and authenticates. The token is for the machine, not for "
"the network."
msgstr "**第三列是被允許，而不是被推薦。** 產生第四列的那道護欄擋掉的是「一個沒有認證的服務跑在可路由位址上」這種意外；它並不會讓這個設定變成安全的設定。這裡沒有 TLS，所以權杖會在每一次握手時以明文穿過網路，任何看得到流量的人從那一刻起就握有它。單一一份共用密鑰也不是身分：所有連進來的人都是同一個無名氏，而且沒辦法只撤銷其中一個持有者，除非把檔案換掉、所有人一起換。如果這個服務真的必須回應另一台機器，就把它留在 loopback 上，並在它前面放一台反向代理，由代理終結 TLS 並負責認證。權杖是給機器用的，不是給網路用的。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:59
#: 4ea92a772bb441849de3b871cffddf01
msgid "Prove the chain works"
msgstr "驗證整條鏈路是通的"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:61
#: 713e9544be5b406bbb3362948b1c832b
msgid ""
"Press **run reference check** at the top of the centre column. It opens a"
" session on the market from `HANDLERS.md`, prices the option that "
"document prices, and shows the answer:"
msgstr ""
"按下中間欄上方的 **run reference check**。它會以 `HANDLERS.md` "
"的市場開一個工作階段，為那份文件所計價的選擇權定價，並顯示答案："

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:65
#: ede321adddf44d1e82b752d34804667b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\text{NPV} = 12.459717"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:67
#: e446f031a41043d8a361ff18db1e98a6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If that number comes back, the whole chain is working — socket, schema, "
"market construction, engine dispatch and the result mapping. If it does "
"not, the problem is below the interface, and {doc}`troubleshooting` is "
"the page for it."
msgstr ""
"只要這個數字回來了，整條鏈路就是通的——連線、結構描述、市場建構、引擎派工，以及結果對應。若沒有回來，問題出在介面之下，該看的是 "
"{doc}`troubleshooting`。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:71
#: 2a50418243bc42b7a792850427b953ab
msgid ""
"Two further things are worth doing in the first five minutes, because "
"they are what the application is *for*:"
msgstr "前五分鐘還有兩件事值得做，因為它們正是這個應用程式存在的理由："

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:74
#: 2c1924162ae84791bf142e93fc4e4d97
msgid ""
"**Drag a quote slider** in the bar along the bottom. The price follows "
"and nothing is rebuilt — writes coalesce so only one round trip is ever "
"in flight. This is the live graph doing its job."
msgstr "**拖動底部列的報價滑桿。**價格會跟著走，而且沒有任何東西被重建——寫入會合併，所以任何時刻只有一次往返在飛。這就是即時物件圖在做它的工作。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:77
#: 353471e07cc94f38a2efacccdf26468f
msgid ""
"**Stop the service and start it again.** The socket reconnects, the "
"workbook replays into a new session, and the trade reprices — the client "
"owns the market definition, which is what makes that possible. Cut the "
"connection without stopping the service and you get the other path: the "
"session is held for a minute, and the app takes it back with the same id "
"and the same graph."
msgstr "**把服務停掉再啟動。**連線會重新接上，工作簿會重播成一個新的工作階段，交易重新計價——市場定義由用戶端擁有，這才使它成為可能。若不停掉服務而只是切斷連線，走的是另一條路：工作階段會被保留一分鐘，應用程式會以同一個代號、同一份物件圖把它接回來。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:84
#: c22adc2d8be0486598214beecba9bf6b
msgid "Keep this open beside it"
msgstr "把它開在旁邊"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:86
#: 41f9540d1dd54d3ca05ba8050e04ba59
msgid ""
"The **Guide** button at the right-hand end of the status bar opens this "
"document in a tab of its own — a tab of its own on purpose, because "
"navigating away drops the socket, and a session only outlives that for a "
"minute."
msgstr "狀態列最右端的 **Guide** 按鈕會在獨立分頁開啟這份文件——刻意用獨立分頁，因為離開頁面就會斷線，而工作階段只能比連線多活一分鐘。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:90
#: 5c012c589ea34cfd95689ae5ec5262d1
msgid ""
"The guide's front page, opened from the workbench's status bar: the "
"sidebar with both tables of contents, the search box, the English/Chinese"
" switch, and the three-layer figure."
msgstr "從工作台狀態列開啟的說明書首頁：側邊欄有兩份目錄、搜尋框、中英文切換，以及三層架構圖。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:94
#: 5c012c589ea34cfd95689ae5ec5262d1
msgid ""
"What the button opens. It points at `doc/_build/html/index.html`, which "
"is where `npm run docs` writes this guide and which the dev server serves"
" from the project root; a deployment that serves it elsewhere sets "
"`VITE_DOCS_URL`."
msgstr ""
"按鈕開啟的內容。它指向 `doc/_build/html/index.html`，也就是 `npm run docs` "
"寫出這份說明書的位置，而開發伺服器會從專案根目錄提供它；若部署時放在別處，設定 `VITE_DOCS_URL`。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:99
#: 69789176aa5b469f822ef61f028dd8a6
msgid ""
"If the button gives you a 404, the guide has not been built yet — `npm "
"run docs` is the whole of the fix."
msgstr "如果按鈕給你 404，代表說明書還沒建置——`npm run docs` 就是全部的修法。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:102
#: a4b233e31f3443c4aa19f471e07fbf9f
msgid "The door"
msgstr "門"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:104
#: c750c13e8dba47fb8bf7a0a6cb6c46e7
msgid ""
"The service checks the browser's `Origin` on the WebSocket upgrade. This "
"is not belt-and-braces: a WebSocket upgrade is **not** subject to the "
"same-origin policy, so binding the service to loopback is no protection "
"against a page — any tab could otherwise open `ws://127.0.0.1:9111` and "
"spend the machine's CPU on it."
msgstr ""
"服務會在 WebSocket 升級時檢查瀏覽器送來的 `Origin`。這不是多此一舉：WebSocket "
"升級**不**受同源政策約束，所以把服務綁在本機回送位址並不能擋住網頁——否則任何一個分頁都能開啟 `ws://127.0.0.1:9111` "
"並吃光這台機器的 CPU。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:110
#: 7760264621ba4b4787e8c7658e204d93
msgid ""
"The defaults already include the Vite dev and preview origins "
"(`localhost` and `127.0.0.1` on ports 5173 and 4173). Serve this app from"
" anywhere else and start the service with `--allow-origin <that origin>`,"
" or the socket is refused with `403` before the app can say anything "
"about it. A client that sends no `Origin` header at all — a script, a "
"proxy that already checked — is unaffected, which is why the command-line"
" tools keep working."
msgstr ""
"預設清單已包含 Vite 的開發與預覽來源（`localhost` 與 `127.0.0.1` 的 5173 與 4173 "
"埠）。若從其他位址提供本應用程式，請以 `--allow-origin <該來源>` 啟動服務，否則連線會在應用程式來得及說任何話之前就被 "
"`403` 拒絕。完全不送 `Origin` 標頭的用戶端——腳本，或已經檢查過的代理伺服器——不受影響，這也是命令列工具照常運作的原因。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:117
#: a4187e2d386f4abd962da32f39fc2ab7
msgid "The token, on a machine you share"
msgstr "共用機器上的權杖"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:119
#: 0924703d319140f696780104b5722f0b
msgid ""
"The origin check bets that whoever might abuse the service is a page "
"rather than a process. On your own machine that is the right bet. Where "
"other people have accounts on the same box it is the wrong one, because "
"any of their processes can open the port directly and no proxy in front "
"of the service changes that: a proxy stands beside it, not in front of "
"its loopback socket."
msgstr ""
"origin "
"檢查賭的是：可能濫用這個服務的是一個網頁，而不是一個行程。在你自己的機器上，這個賭注是對的。當同一台機器上還有別人的帳號時，它就是錯的，因為他們的任何行程都能直接打開這個埠，而在服務前面放一台代理並不會改變這件事：代理站在它旁邊，不是站在它的"
" loopback socket 前面。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:125
#: dacc239aa0124fdd845d1871dee5487b
msgid ""
"`--token-file FILE` is the answer to exactly that. The service reads the "
"secret from the file, or mints one at first use and writes it with owner-"
"only permissions, and after that every client presents it or is refused "
"with `401` before a socket exists. This app sends it when `VITE_WS_TOKEN`"
" is set:"
msgstr ""
"`--token-file FILE` "
"正是針對這件事的答案。服務會從檔案讀出密鑰，或在第一次使用時鑄一份出來、以只有擁有者讀得到的權限寫進去；在那之後，每個客戶端都得出示它，否則會在 "
"socket 存在之前就被以 `401` 拒絕。設了 `VITE_WS_TOKEN` 時，這個應用程式就會送出它："

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:135
#: 02def40786a749cf97017d9d724d22d8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Two things follow from where that secret ends up. A token this app can "
"send is a token in the bundle it serves, so it keeps out another user's "
"process rather than one running as you, and `.env` is ignored by git for "
"the same reason. {doc}`limits` is where that boundary is written down in "
"full."
msgstr ""
"從那份密鑰最後落在哪裡，會推出兩件事。這個應用程式送得出去的權杖，就是一份放在它所提供的 bundle "
"裡的權杖，所以它擋的是其他使用者的行程，而不是以你自己的身分執行的行程；`.env` 被 git 忽略也是同一個理由。{doc}`limits` "
"是把那道邊界完整寫下來的地方。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:140
#: 2cab0bbd82274598867882a86f6e958e
msgid ""
"An address that is not loopback and no token is refused at startup rather"
" than served, because a pricing engine answering the network with no "
"authentication is an accident far more often than it is a decision."
msgstr ""
"位址不是 "
"loopback、又沒有權杖時，服務會在啟動時拒絕跑起來，而不是照樣提供服務：一個沒有認證卻對著網路應答的計價引擎，是意外的機會遠大於是決定。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:144
#: 02bfebeefb5c45838a15edc37d672ebd
msgid "The vocabulary"
msgstr "詞彙"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:146
#: fa563bfac90043b2a4f11049381c8ad9
msgid ""
"Four words are used precisely throughout this guide and throughout the "
"interface."
msgstr "本說明書與介面自始至終都精確地使用這四個詞。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:149
#: 69f39a4163fe4a0e985ee3ea0f5a86d2
msgid "Session"
msgstr "工作階段（session）"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:150
#: b5be0eb723e04ab8996281f311a16a3a
msgid ""
"One live QuantLib object graph on the service, holding a worker seat. It "
"is opened with a market, it survives between requests, and it outlives "
"its socket by a grace window — a minute by default — so a client that "
"drops can take it back rather than rebuild it. Each browser tab holds its"
" own."
msgstr ""
"服務上的一份 QuantLib "
"即時物件圖，佔用一個工作者席位。它以一個市場開啟，在多次請求之間存續，並比它的連線多活一段寬限期——預設一分鐘——因此斷線的用戶端可以把它接回來，而不必重建。每個瀏覽器分頁各持有自己的一份。"

#: ../../../Users/mark/WebstormProjects/ql-frontend/doc/getting-started.md:155
#: aee5fa43d0c54fad8811793d61cc5962
msgid "Workbook"
msgstr "工作簿（workbook）"

