#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The document *this app* owns: the market definition, the trade, and the "
"panel state. It survives a refresh, exports as canonical Protobuf JSON, "
"and is what gets replayed into a new session when a dropped one cannot be"
" taken back. {doc}`interface` sets out the whole split of what is kept "
"where."
msgstr ""
"*本應用程式*擁有的文件：市場定義、交易，以及面板狀態。它能撐過重新整理，可匯出為標準的 Protobuf "
"JSON，並在斷掉的工作階段接不回來時，被重播成一個新的工作階段。{doc}`interface` 完整說明了什麼東西存放在哪一邊。"

