msgid ""
"A change to the shape of the graph — a curve, an index, the evaluation "
"date. It cannot be written into a running session, so it needs a rebuild."
msgstr "改變物件圖形狀的變更——曲線、利率指標、評價日。它無法寫進執行中的工作階段，因此需要重建。"

